  "releaseNotes": "v1.7.4: Query() returns IQueryBuilder (awaitable, fluent OrderBy/GroupBy); QueryPaginated() returns IQueryPaginatedBuilder; QueryRaw/QueryRawSync with SQL injection prevention (SELECT only, no semicolons, no comments, no DDL/DML); OrderBy and GroupBy accept string[]; RelationalColumn and DataAggregationColumn for ETL/DW fact queries; DataAggregationColumn excluded from WHERE; null-safe range filter; Pluggable cache providers (ICacheProvider); parameterized queries; reflection caching; [Key] attribute for PK + _id suffix convention for FK detection. v1.6.8: date range by value type; null-safe ranges; empty string exclusion; KeyColumns cache by entity type; array skip. v1.6.6: [Table] and [Column] optional; enum as string literals; empty strings as ''; PostgreSQL compliant.",
